(text "Bank TPS48100 VBAT_P -> VBAT_SLOTS: 5 mOhm + 61.9k = SCP 22.4/28.6/35.0 A, 68\nnF + 100k latch-off 517-1490 us (5x the slot timer). Hardware overload cutoff:\nINA281A2 -> 220k/1 uF -> TLV3012B -> 1G74 latch -> U110 UVLO low; trip\n3.16-3.73 A HOT (default) or 5.06-5.98 A ROOM (0x22 P13), 32-217 ms inverse\ntime; clear by toggling BANK_EN.\nEach slot: TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 5 mOhm + 24.3k = SCP 10.6/13.5/16.5 A,\n4.7 nF + 100k latch-off 36-103 us. Gate dV/dt on bank and slots: 150R G1PU +\n22 nF/10R to GND = 1.9 V/us. TPS2553 210k (+3V3 main, 110-150 mA), FAULT\nwired-OR with FLT onto SLn_PWR_FAULT_N.\nPWR_EN = NOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (1G02); OUT_EN_N = NAND(PWR_EN,\nGLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW, NOT ARM_N) (1G04 + 1G10). +3V3_ID via 68R 1206. Ladder and\nmath: MODULAR_ARCHITECTURE section 14, docs/modular/pass2_calc.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 692.15 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "44c223cf-4653-4e9f-9c47-a5cf1e667e7d"))
(embedded_fonts no))
